# A row whose choices overflow the box paints a window around the active
# one and marks the hidden side with an arrow, so `→` never steps onto a
# value the user cannot see. At 120x40 the box is centred vertically and
# `TODOS sort` (row 21, under the section strip; four choices) has 32
# cells for its options; the full list needs 36.
command view.settings
expect screen contains "TODOS sort:                        [newest] / oldest / name ›"
click 40 21
key right
key right
key right
expect screen contains "TODOS sort:                        ‹ oldest / name / [name_desc]"
key right
expect screen contains "TODOS sort:                        [newest] / oldest / name ›"
